    {
      "id": "97b509e7-82bd-45b3-a156-debc2039b39a",
      "title": "Compare as duas aberturas e observe quando cada uma faz mais sentido.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "1e8285a4-a276-41e9-84d2-d62ca2d659f7",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>¿Podría decirme si...?</strong> ajuda a confirmar um detalhe concreto do imóvel.</p><p><strong>¿Habría posibilidad de...?</strong> ajuda a abrir uma opção ou verificar disponibilidade.</p><p>Em um contato real, você pode passar de um molde ao outro sem mudar o tom polido.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5b9b4d3a-51a3-484e-bcde-1d8950e63710",
      "title": "Primeiro contato sobre o anúncio",
      "description": "<p>As falas são curtas e realistas: primeiro a pessoa confirma detalhes do imóvel e depois pergunta sobre a visita.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Buenas tardes. ¿Podría decirme si está amueblado?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Boa tarde. Poderia me dizer se está mobiliado?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/810c4e3bc3ef4b9a94b30607057bc49b_b07-dialogo-cliente-01.mp3?Expires=1794099606&Signature=b5eyyzmS9jXp3tI1yHmVK-1Cq1xES6TUd769OPNr2HW2q-K27gf-ba0GX2NMBf8ce90uG501pRf2Xcb6ta2xEu5lc4Rjmm1Os60Jp2bzWuiEMW6Tfj7qFwVj~3cz1D0fmUm5ONo1XfTjU9gHBhwcV3n1lx6nJHQ3uAIzvLlHq~ygxEhQDPOSVsqnXj7~c8ZWc4OVYtzCQE~gbPZro6ILuulO1XEnvHW64TWtJrqf~hUtXNpzeJ05SLVhCxmsndhMIf~QiFX2ciLj9Ptmb~ZdTNejpIzWxhzpCJMmVe3EUw9VhpeSzMSYPbaNR73rC5UVb6ibkNuvK1qnpz86ZOYmjA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Sí, está amueblado y los gastos están incluidos.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Sim, está mobiliado e os gastos estão incluídos.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c43700d2e1924a8ca0c4b01b3d0c0543_b07-inmobiliaria-02.mp3?Expires=1794099606&Signature=b9Za0YRZXJm3YWKjKtGUibxzPWurUK~IoBo6THYa5LMHARGzvdRkND3AyjCIJ2CfcO4DDSqBuZeFffoSIueDFXvMg0WF~RVA7TNyRZUoddekGiH2qmgEqd0sp5aT3SADE1GbVYvndm768wReOOXNWNTHrlaHtb404H3FK1BQhIQ0JZAkyNWWhyC0MHGfbB8m4NIIIFxLYxgJDitcV7eoYC5xScZUHTznhTqe-R~FrjE0ygBDTDPMPsFMTrCuh8I5uj09N663SF8NFQE-jQHxJiP1srrDHy5nkZwG-3b66c~Rb4GafUjRnyoYorQSuC~4PeooJvJYOlsIx6zLkW0p2Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Gracias. ¿Habría posibilidad de hacer una visita esta semana?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Obrigada. Haveria possibilidade de fazer uma visita esta semana?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/27612dccc12d45de86d4496f3279d6a8_b07-dialogo-cliente-03.mp3?Expires=1794099606&Signature=TO5SRclza-XbSezCUxpy6cQb4sR~gfK-U8a6vk7aMcbGKviBy4QRywj6GrZ76MRCB8ubQR5hHty8XM0bWOu7eZ9l9AkewvRsxeaXOPiDoUNqJJoLlpFpZhbx5zRkUAK2P0GWV97QuWNY18YtaFT2HNdH6yEoO2l0te0G0xCM5q~0UZd8ETT3owkidCmSCvWGxEBQY8f3lnS2FpHcVdYiQMYf4fEM75LrXL57CWBwj7UrmD11873wcln4wH8Y-hOWTDEfpI5Z4w6ioJkLKb6dp20aeCkRT6WH2f-NahGBPdUuIPJT9jMSB~w86fmkZCzaX6YQVQmEsHPZuey-LXBFQg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Sí, tenemos una visita disponible el jueves por la tarde.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Sim, temos uma visita disponível na quinta à tarde.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6280ce27ddaa44c39f97690912416866_b07-inmobiliaria-04.mp3?Expires=1794099606&Signature=NY2En8FMbcrU5MW5UWRcAkO~lB8C7H7gKQ3RBg0k5IhNf4hDN4vRi5gi1Il~BRELtn6YjLbnapZ11Dh0ON1ManRu6YXJ-Fr06it0ZAG2iHgZvDvE3Pa0r1FzPH~cvzQa1nfKjghW4wtWh7dV1wPVDm61OY91mXq52JA0-JIEVQh-z9iDtZdi6c6aM3hvEDRW8NO13xXz-sbX1JobTmDs2wZJLs54nEpvBw8PUt0dRuWveKRDlZjR6UEZkcbJx34Z-WoH03~vPMekJXc8UrF5XLcYcU34QFt0HUnw8awX9thZTN6s3grpNg2bzwYxl6c85SDZgs3H-PTVhukWmka73w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        }
